| `decisions-ledger.md` | Phase 0 | Every phase gate | Records all decisions |
| `artifact-manifest.md` | Phase 0 | Every phase gate | Tracks all files |
| `metrics-tracker.md` | Phase 0 | Every phase gate | Records metrics |

### Phase-Specific Documents

| Phase | Documents Created |
