| 0 | README.md, scope.md, constraints.md, success-criteria.md |
| 1 | research/*.md (6 files) |
| 2 | architecture/kb-architecture.md, entry-schema.json, bridge-schema.json, population-strategy.md, directory-structure.md |
| 3 | kb/* (all KB files) |
| 4 | architecture/phase-structure.md, task-granularity.md, dependency-map.md, phase-gates.md, document-tree.md |

